<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea to develp mine region into leisure spot.</title>
<headline>S.Korea to develp mine region into leisure spot.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea will invest a total of 2.54 trillion won to develop a mining region into a large-scale resort area, the Ministry of Construction and Transportation said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
